e conflicting \nneeds by defining prompt templates (in jinja format) in separate yamls that users can easily modify and by autogenerated\na `PromptFactory` class with meaningful method and parameter names from these yamls. The latter is committed to our code.\nWe separated out the generation logic into the [interprompt](/src/interprompt/README.md) subpackage that can be used as a library.\n\n### Tempfiles and Snapshots for Testing of Editing Tools"}},{"id":"3744780a-c253-40f7-86b9-0fbfb9c60b9b","values":[-0.06255383044481277,-0.015538698062300682,0.03646179661154747,-0.024833766743540764,0.1107305958867073,-0.09130658954381943,-0.06339166313409805,0.052587997168302536,-0.017149215564131737,0.0727880597114563,0.007410358637571335,-0.008955399505794048,0.026087835431098938,-0.0021918376442044973,-0.03683340176939964,-0.025047726929187775,0.008626027964055538,-0.03240686655044556,-0.008263339288532734,0.021716583520174026,-0.05890149250626564,-0.025128820911049843,0.023518411442637444,0.027542967349290848,-0.07837443053722382,0.0865897685289383,-0.023113174363970757,-0.0952576994895935,-0.07569091022014618,-0.04301821067929268,0.009969673119485378,0.10264815390110016,-0.013739312067627907,-0.0045045120641589165,0.14580586552619934,0.13932713866233826,0.05453895777463913,-0.02908816561102867,-0.03587814047932625,-0.08739099651575089,0.0066988770850002766,-0.03910450264811516,0.0333675742149353,0.024841168895363808,-0.05488267540931702,-0.08758246153593063,-0.011707957834005356,-0.10603807866573334,-0.04511289298534393,-0.018798161298036575,-0.08603353053331375,-0.02813272550702095,0.04887460917234421,-0.023037375882267952,0.03523961454629898,-0.035577043890953064,0.03706440329551697,0.0009613617439754307,0.0393717959523201,-0.033336468040943146,-0.013931706547737122,0.04910906404256821,-0.056310802698135376,0.022024663165211678,0.07880791276693344,0.03995048254728317,0.04152951017022133,0.06177220866084099,0.06559179723262787,0.03412171080708504,-0.042964886873960495,-0